# Implementation Plan - Fix `@/lib/utils` Import Error

The goal is to resolve the TypeScript error "Cannot find module '@/lib/utils' or its corresponding type declarations" by ensuring the path mapping in [tsconfig.json](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/tsconfig.json) is correctly configured and recognized by the TypeScript compiler.

## Proposed Changes

### Configuration

#### [MODIFY] [tsconfig.json](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/tsconfig.json)

- Add `"baseUrl": "."` to `compilerOptions`. This ensures that the `paths` mapping relative to `./src/*` is correctly resolved from the project root.

